ROWS = (
    ('focus.hyprland_other_workspace', 'A headed focus-window on an accessible window and on a compositor-only toplevel, each alone on a workspace no monitor shows, makes j/activewindow name that toplevel and pid, leaves j/clients placing it on its workspace and has j/monitors show that workspace; focus, cursor and workspaces return to the bystander', 'Calculator, foot and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi'), 'pass'),
    ('focus.hyprland_twin_after_sizes_differ', 'Once a third window gives same-titled native Wayland twins distinct j/clients sizes, a headed focus-window on each frame in turn makes j/activewindow name the toplevel of that frame size, the second twin included', 'Focus Twins, foot and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi'), 'pass'),
    ('focus.hyprland_same_size_twins_ambiguous', 'A headed focus-window on either of two same-titled native Wayland twins of one size refuses with AMBIGUOUS_TARGET naming both j/clients addresses and workspaces, not_delivered, while j/activewindow, the cursor, the workspaces and both twins stay as they were', 'Focus Twins and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi'), 'pass'),
    ('focus.hyprland_closed_window_not_found', 'A headed focus-window on a closed accessible frame and on a closed compositor-only toplevel, both gone from j/clients, refuses with WINDOW_NOT_FOUND, not_delivered, while j/activewindow, the cursor and the workspaces stay as they were', 'Calculator, foot and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('focus.headless_existing_focus_or_refusal', 'Headless focus-window and press --window-id on the key log app refuse with POLICY_DENIED window_not_focused and STALE_REF exact_window_focus_unconfirmed while the bystander holds focus, and with hidden_special_workspace while the app sits on a hidden special workspace, before and after it held focus, with no key in the app log and focus, cursor and workspaces unchanged; once j/activewindow, a shown workspace and the raw frame ACTIVE all name the app, focus-window proves focus with activated false and press delivers x without changing the desktop', 'Key Log and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'applog'), 'pass'),
    ('focus.contradictory_or_missing_proof_refused', 'While j/activewindow names an app whose raw frame never reports ACTIVE, a headed press --window-id on its native Wayland window and a headed press on its XWayland window each refuse within the 5000 ms deadline plus 1 s with ACTION_FAILED frame_not_active, activation_sent true, not_delivered and a cursor_moved side effect for any cursor the activation moved, and the app logs no key; once the frame reports ACTIVE, the same press delivers x on each window; with ACTIVE withheld and with agreeing proof, a headed ref click refuses before any activation as native_wayland_client on the native window and as receiver_unproven on the XWayland window, with physical_delivery_started false and not_delivered, no button in the app log, and j/activewindow and the cursor unchanged', 'Inactive Frame on Wayland and XWayland, and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'applog'), 'asserted-refusal', 'ACTION_FAILED, cause frame_not_active, activation_sent true, physical_delivery_started false, not_delivered with the activation named in the message and details, within 6000 ms; a headed ref click gives ACTION_FAILED native_wayland_client or receiver_unproven, not_delivered, with no activation'),
    ('focus.hyprland_activation_proof_reported', 'A headed focus-window on Calculator and on a foot terminal, each alone on a workspace no monitor shows, reports activated true with proof compositor_and_accessibility for Calculator, whose raw AT-SPI frame goes from no ACTIVE state to ACTIVE, and compositor_only for foot, and names as side_effects exactly the workspace switch and cursor move that j/monitors and j/cursorpos show across the call', 'Calculator, foot and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi'), 'pass'),
    ('focus.hyprland_in_view_no_invented_switch', 'A headed focus-window on a foot terminal on the workspace already in view reports activated true with no workspace effect while j/monitors shows no change, and a second focus on it, now the active window, reports activated false and no side_effects', 'foot and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland',), 'pass'),
    ('focus.hyprland_special_reveal_and_close_reported', 'A headed focus-window on a terminal on hidden special workspace a reports it revealed, one on special workspace b reports a closed and b revealed, and the return to a reports b closed and a revealed, each matching j/monitors; a terminal on the regular workspace under open a is refused with ACTION_FAILED, cause special_workspace_open naming a, not_delivered, while the desktop stays as it was', 'foot and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland',), 'pass'),
    ('lifecycle.hyprland_close_app_every_window', 'close-app on a process with two native Wayland windows leaves j/clients listing no toplevel of it and the process exited in /proc, while the toplevels of Calculator, a foot terminal and the bystander keep their address, pid, workspace and mapping, and focus, cursor and workspaces stay with the bystander', 'Close Pair, Calculator, foot and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('lifecycle.hyprland_close_app_gone_app_not_found', 'After close-app removes Calculator from j/clients and /proc, a second close-app on the same name refuses with APP_NOT_FOUND, not_delivered and exit 1, while the foot and bystander toplevels, focus, cursor and workspaces stay as they were', 'Calculator, foot and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('lifecycle.hyprland_close_app_holds_for_a_parented_unrelated_dialog', 'With a modal Gtk.Dialog transient for a GTK4 application window but outside its GtkApplication, so the two toplevels carry unrelated app ids, close-app refuses with ACTION_FAILED, cause dialog_pending, one dialog, not_delivered, while j/clients still maps both toplevels, /proc shows the process running, the app logs no close request, and the bystander toplevels, focus, cursor and workspaces stay', 'Dialog Host and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('lifecycle.hyprland_close_app_holds_for_an_unparented_unrelated_dialog', 'With a Gtk.Dialog that has no parent and is outside the GtkApplication of a GTK4 window, close-app refuses with ACTION_FAILED, cause dialog_pending, one dialog, not_delivered, while j/clients still maps both toplevels, /proc shows the process running, the app logs no close request, and the bystander toplevels, focus, cursor and workspaces stay', 'Dialog Host and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('lifecycle.hyprland_floating_move_resize', 'On a foot terminal alone on a spare workspace, move-window on the tiled window refuses with tiled_window and leaves j/clients unchanged; once it floats, move-window and resize-window are delivered_verified and j/clients shows it at 40,60 and 500x400; a repeated move is not_delivered; the bystander toplevel, focus, cursor and workspaces stay as they were', 'foot and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('lifecycle.hyprland_minimize_restore', 'minimize moves a foot terminal to special:agent-desktop-minimized-<workspace> without showing it, a repeated minimize is not_delivered, a move while minimized refuses with window_minimized, and restore puts it back on its workspace at its size, each read from j/clients, while the bystander toplevel, focus, cursor and workspaces stay as they were', 'foot and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('lifecycle.hyprland_maximize_restore', 'maximize on a floating foot terminal refuses with maximize_takes_focus while the bystander holds focus; once the terminal holds focus, maximize sets j/clients fullscreen 1 without moving focus, a resize refuses with window_maximized, and restore gives fullscreen 0 at its floating geometry; a legacy config refuses with legacy_config_focused_only', 'foot and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('lifecycle.hyprland_window_operation_refusals', 'On the window sizer parked tiled on a spare workspace, in either mode, move and resize refuse with tiled_window, maximize while the bystander holds focus with maximize_takes_focus, minimize, maximize and restore of the window while another tool hides it with foreign_special_workspace, and maximize or move while it is minimized with window_minimized; every operation on a closed window id gives WINDOW_NOT_FOUND; j/clients, the sizer process and its log stay unchanged, focus, cursor and workspaces stay with the bystander throughout, and a floating move then works in the same mode', 'Window Sizer and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, BOTH_MODES, ('hyprland', 'proc'), 'asserted-refusal', 'ACTION_NOT_SUPPORTED, causes tiled_window, maximize_takes_focus, foreign_special_workspace and window_minimized, and WINDOW_NOT_FOUND for a closed window id; each exits 1 with not_delivered and physical_delivery_started false'),
    ('input.hyprland_type_text_virtual_keyboard', 'A headed type into a focused GTK3 entry delivers the text with mixed case, punctuation and digits through a virtual keyboard: the step is VirtualKeyboard.type_text, the entry reads the text through AT-SPI, the app logs each letter and digit press in order, a second type appends, and j/devices lists the same keyboards and layout state before and after', 'Key Log and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'applog'), 'pass'),
    ('input.hyprland_press_chord_virtual_keyboard', 'Scoped press --window-id on the focused window sends chords through a virtual keyboard: ctrl+a then x replaces abc with x, shift+a appends A with Shift in the state the app logs, each step is VirtualKeyboard.press_key, and j/devices keeps the same keyboards', 'Key Log and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'applog'), 'pass'),
    ('input.hyprland_type_non_us_layout', 'With kb_layout us,ru and the Russian layout active on the main keyboard, a headed type of Cyrillic text reads back exactly through AT-SPI, the app logs every Cyrillic press in layout group 1, typing leaves j/devices as it was, and the original kb_layout and layout state come back', 'Key Log and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'applog'), 'pass'),
    ('input.hyprland_focus_change_mid_batch_uncertain', 'When focus moves to the bystander while a long headed type runs, delivery stops with delivery_uncertain, physical_delivery_started true and a delivered_events count below the total, the entry holds a strict prefix of the text, the bystander keeps focus, j/devices lists no leftover keyboard, and a later type of q arrives with no modifier held', 'Key Log and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'applog'), 'pass'),
    ('cursor.session_renderer_lifetime', 'session start --cursor answers rendered true and starts one renderer: j/layers lists one agent-desktop-cursor surface on the overlay level whose pid the renderer record names, in its own process group with no lease variable; a second enable keeps that renderer; session end answers cursor_renderer stopped and the layer, the process and the record are gone', 'Hyprland session', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('cursor.no_focus_or_input_interference', 'With the cursor rendered, a click on Calculator through the session changes its display while j/activewindow, the cursor position and the workspaces, polled throughout, stay with the bystander; disable answers stopped and removes the layer', 'Calculator and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('cursor.window_capture_excludes_overlay', 'With the cursor drawn at the Calculator button it clicked, grim of the monitor differs from the same capture after disable at the arrow, and screenshot --window-id does not', 'Calculator', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'pixels', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('cursor.disable_end_crash_and_compositor_loss', 'disable and session end answer stopped and remove the layer, the process and the record; after a SIGKILL the compositor drops the layer and the next enable starts a new generation; a renderer on a second instance exits and removes its record when that instance stops, and session end then answers not_running', 'Hyprland session and a second instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('cursor.agent_identity_and_profiles', 'In a multi-agent session, agent-a by --agent-id and agent-b by AGENT_DESKTOP_AGENT_ID each click a Calculator button and j/layers lists two agent-desktop-cursor surfaces on the overlay level, one tip on each button, both drawn by the renderer the session record names; agent-b\'s size 2 profile draws the larger surface; another session\'s agent gets a third surface from its own renderer; each session end removes its renderer\'s surfaces, process and record', 'Calculator', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('cursor.missing_agent_id_refused', 'In a multi-agent session a click with no agent id refuses with INVALID_ARGS and exit 1, the Calculator display stays as it was and no renderer record or cursor surface appears; the same click with --agent-id changes the display and draws a cursor at the button', 'Calculator', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'asserted-refusal', "the leg asserts the product's refusal as its expected outcome"),
    ('cursor.arrival_ack_before_dispatch', 'An agent\'s click on a Calculator button reaches the app only after its cursor arrives: the first AT-SPI display read that shows the click is followed by a j/layers read with the cursor tip already on the button', 'Calculator', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('cursor.arrival_ack_before_dispatch_delayed', 'With the renderer\'s test flag delaying each arrival acknowledgement 600 ms after the renderer received the travel, inside the 900 ms arrival timeout, an agent\'s click on a Calculator button still succeeds and lands once, and an AT-SPI display read that started after the traced acknowledgement still shows the old display; with the flag gone the next click lands and nothing is traced', 'Calculator', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('cursor.arrival_ack_before_dispatch_withheld', 'With the renderer\'s test flag withholding every arrival acknowledgement, an agent\'s click on a Calculator button reaches the app no earlier than the arrival timeout after the first travel was received: a display read that started 850 ms after it still shows the old display, the trace shows no acknowledgement sent, and the click then lands once because travel is presentation only; with the flag gone the next click lands and nothing is traced', 'Calculator', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('pointer.global_layout_coordinates', 'On a nested instance whose pad output sits at a negative origin and scale 1.25, mouse-move puts j/cursorpos on the global point, and a click, wheel steps both ways and a drag land in the pad log at the point j/clients and j/monitors predict, as does a move onto the other output and a click back from it', 'Pointer pad on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog'), 'pass'),
    ('pointer.ref_receiver_evidence', 'Every headed ref pointer action (click, double-click, triple-click, right-click, scroll and both ends of a ref drag) on an XWayland pad on a nested instance refuses with ACTION_FAILED, kind receiver_evidence, cause receiver_unproven, physical_delivery_started false and not_delivered, its message and suggestion naming the routes without --headed and with --xy: on the bare pad, under a floating and a pinned foot, and on GTK4 fixtures whose target sits under an in-window overlay or a same-client popup; a click under a slurp layer refuses the same way; the apps log no input, and away from the slurp layer the cursor and the active window stay where they were', 'Pointer pad, slurp, foot and GTK4 fixtures on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog'), 'asserted-refusal', 'D12: on XWayland a headed ref pointer action refuses with receiver_unproven before any pointer or modifier event, and D11 refuses it on native Wayland (pointer.native_wayland_ref_refused); ACTION_FAILED, physical_delivery_started false, not_delivered'),
    ('pointer.cover_or_missing_evidence_refused', 'A ref click refuses with receiver_evidence and no event for a pad on a hidden special workspace, for a pad under the shell layers of the session instance, and for a pad under a floating or a pinned foot on a nested instance; the pad and the covers stay unchanged', 'Pointer pad, foot and the session shell', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog'), 'asserted-refusal', 'ACTION_FAILED, kind receiver_evidence, causes target_not_shown, layer_cover and window_cover, physical_delivery_started false, not_delivered; unreadable layers cannot be produced from outside the compositor and are covered by unit tests'),
    ('pointer.coordinates_have_no_receiver_proof', 'Coordinate clicks of count 1, 2 and 3, a wheel step and a drag land in the pad log while each envelope reports receiver_proof false and its delivered events; a point on no output refuses with point_off_output and no event', 'Pointer pad on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('applog',), 'pass'),
    ('pointer.headless_or_cancelled_input', 'Without headed permission, coordinate click, wheel and drag and ref double-click, triple-click and scroll refuse with POLICY_DENIED before the pointer moves; j/cursorpos and the pad log stay unchanged', 'Pointer pad on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'applog'), 'asserted-refusal', 'POLICY_DENIED, not_delivered, physical_delivery_started false; cursor and pad log unchanged'),
    ('pointer.native_wayland_ref_refused', 'On a native Wayland pad on a nested instance, j/clients shows xwayland false, and a headed ref click, double-click, triple-click and scroll each refuse with ACTION_FAILED, cause native_wayland_client, physical_delivery_started false and not_delivered, while the pad logs no event', 'Pointer pad on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog'), 'asserted-refusal', 'ACTION_FAILED, cause native_wayland_client, physical_delivery_started false, not_delivered; the pad log is unchanged'),
    ('pointer.cancel_or_disconnect_releases_buttons', 'SIGTERM during a drag stops later events and releases the held button in the pad log, and the next drag works; a nested compositor killed during a drag gives delivery_uncertain with unsafe retry, its partial counts and buttons_released false', 'Pointer pad on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('applog', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('pointer.hover_by_ref_refused', 'Hover by ref refuses at once with hover_unsupported, not_delivered and no physical delivery for an XWayland and a native pad and for a GTK4 XWayland window whose popup covers the target; j/cursorpos and the logs stay unchanged', 'Pointer pad and GTK4 popup on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog'), 'asserted-refusal', 'ACTION_NOT_SUPPORTED, cause hover_unsupported, within 2000 ms'),
    ('pointer.hover_coordinates', 'hover --xy delivers: j/cursorpos reads the point', 'Pointer pad on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog'), 'pass'),
    ('pointer.coordinate_multi_click_xwayland', 'mouse-click --xy --count 2|3 lands that many clicks on the target of the gtk3, gtk4 and qt6 XWayland receiver fixtures as delivered_unverified without receiver proof; headed double-click and triple-click by ref refuse as receiver_unproven with no click logged', 'Receiver fixtures on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog'), 'pass'),
    ('cursor.hide_ack_suppression_until_show', 'With the cursor drawn over the Calculator button it clicked, grim shows it while screenshot --screen, taken before, under a second live holder and after the outputs power off and on, matches the cursor-free screen at the arrow; a live holder clears the cursor and a click under it draws nothing; the cursor returns once the holder leaves, and no holder file outlives its command', 'Calculator', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'pixels', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('cursor.travel_failure_proceeds_hide_failure_refuses', 'A stopped renderer leaves a headless click landing, while screenshot --screen refuses with cursor_hide_timeout or cursor_hide_failed and writes no file, and a headed ref click refuses before any hide with ACTION_FAILED, cause native_wayland_client or receiver_unproven; both are not_delivered with safe retry, leave no holder and do not change the display; once it resumes the capture works, and a killed renderer blocks neither', 'Calculator', HYPRLAND_ONLY, BOTH_MODES, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'asserted-refusal', 'the headed half asserts the hide refusal of the capture and the pre-hide receiver refusal of the click as its expected outcomes; the headless half and the recovery steps must succeed'),
    ('pointer.ref_receiver_evidence_under_cursor', 'With the session cursor layer drawn over an XWayland pad on a nested instance, a headed ref click refuses with ACTION_FAILED, kind receiver_evidence, cause receiver_unproven, physical_delivery_started false and not_delivered, its message and suggestion naming the routes without --headed and with --xy, before it hides the layer; the pad logs no press, the layer stays drawn over the pad through and after the refusal, and session end removes the renderer and its layer', 'Pointer pad on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog', 'proc'), 'asserted-refusal', 'D12: on XWayland a headed ref pointer action refuses with receiver_unproven before any pointer or modifier event, and D11 refuses it on native Wayland (pointer.native_wayland_ref_refused); ACTION_FAILED, physical_delivery_started false, not_delivered'),
    ('pointer.cursor_pass_through', 'With the keep-drawn test flag in the renderer registry and the session cursor layer drawn over an XWayland pad on a nested instance, a headed ref click still refuses with ACTION_FAILED, kind receiver_evidence, cause receiver_unproven, physical_delivery_started false and not_delivered, its message and suggestion naming the routes without --headed and with --xy; the pad logs no press, the layer stays drawn over the pad through and after the refusal, and session end removes the renderer and its layer; no pointer event passes through the layer in this leg; pointer.coordinate_click_through_cursor clicks through it by coordinates', 'Pointer pad on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog', 'proc'), 'asserted-refusal', 'D12: on XWayland a headed ref pointer action refuses with receiver_unproven before any pointer or modifier event, and D11 refuses it on native Wayland (pointer.native_wayland_ref_refused); ACTION_FAILED, physical_delivery_started false, not_delivered'),
    ('cursor.hide_ack_delayed_within_deadline', 'With the cursor drawn over the Calculator button it clicked and the renderer stopped by SIGSTOP on its exact pid, screenshot --screen writes its holder and waits; it has written no file when the renderer resumes 200 ms later, then succeeds with a PNG written after the resume that matches the cursor-free screen at the arrow, leaves no holder, and the cursor returns', 'Calculator', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'pixels', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('cursor.hide_hold_across_agents', 'In a multi-agent session with agent-a\'s cursor drawn over Calculator\'s 7, a second live holder clears it; agent-b\'s click on 8 lands and its screenshot --screen succeeds without the cursor, while every grim under the holder shows neither cursor; once the holder leaves, grim shows both cursors and j/layers lists one tip on each button', 'Calculator', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'pixels', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('cursor.layout_placement_and_hidden_targets', 'With a headless output added at -1024x-640 and scale 1.25 while the renderer runs, a headless click on Calculator\'s 7 on each output puts one cursor surface in j/layers on that output alone with its tip on the button, grim of that output shows the arrow at the button in physical pixels and its size follows the output\'s scale; the renderer survives the output\'s removal; a click while Calculator\'s workspace is hidden draws no cursor on the output that is shown; j/cursorpos never moves', 'Calculator', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'pixels', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('parallel.four_agents_serialized_dispatch', 'Four headless agent processes with distinct agent ids in one multi-agent session, each clicking a different zoo app and queued behind a runner-held interaction lease, all succeed over six rounds; /proc/locks shows their lease holds one at a time, no app logs its click outside its agent\'s hold, every envelope\'s lease contention count matches the observed wait, an injected overlap and an unreported wait each fail the same oracle, and focus, cursor and workspaces stay as they were', 'Zoo GTK3, Zoo GTK4 and Zoo Qt', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'applog', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('parallel.four_agents_three_interleavings', 'With a headless click on Zoo GTK3, a headed type into Zoo GTK4, screenshot --screen and a headed mouse-click --xy at the centre of the Zoo Qt button served in the orders B A D, D B A and A D B, and once with the Qt click holding the lease and its hide holder while the others queue, each effect lands once in its own app, no earlier than its agent\'s hold and at most 1000 ms after its release, the capture shows no cursor, the envelopes report the queueing, and the headless click and the capture leave focus, cursor and workspaces with the bystander; a click with no agent id refuses with INVALID_ARGS, and a headed ref click on the Zoo Qt button refuses with receiver_unproven, not_delivered and no event in its app', 'Zoo GTK3, Zoo GTK4 and Zoo Qt', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog', 'atspi', 'pixels', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('parallel.physical_lock_timeout', 'While the runner holds the interaction lease, a headed type with a 1500 ms timeout and a headed mouse-click --xy with its default 5000 ms budget return TIMEOUT, kind lock_timeout on interaction.lock with a contention count, exit 1 and no event in their apps, and a second C ABI thread in one process returns TIMEOUT, kind interaction_process_lock_timeout; once the lease is released each queued click lands exactly once, no contender sends late input and no child inherits the runner\'s lease', 'Zoo GTK3, Zoo GTK4 and Zoo Qt', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog', 'proc'), 'asserted-refusal', "the leg asserts the contenders' TIMEOUT refusals as its expected outcome; queued delivery after release must succeed"),
    ('parallel.cancel_waiter_and_holder', 'SIGTERM on an agent queued for the interaction lease, on one that has just taken it and on a paced headed type part way through its text leaves no event from the queued agent, frees the lease, leaves a strict prefix in the entry with no safe retry, and no keyboard lost, changed or added other than the input method\'s own virtual keyboard, and in each case the next queued agent takes the lease and lands its click once; the Qt agent clicks with mouse-click --xy', 'Zoo GTK3, Zoo GTK4 and Zoo Qt', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog', 'atspi', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('pointer.hover_by_ref_headless_refused', 'Without headed permission, hover by ref on an XWayland and a native pad on a nested instance refuses with POLICY_DENIED before any event; the pad log, j/cursorpos and j/activewindow stay unchanged', 'Pointer pad on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'applog'), 'asserted-refusal', 'POLICY_DENIED, not_delivered, physical_delivery_started false; cursor, active window and pad log unchanged'),
    ('pointer.ref_drag_refused', 'A headed drag from a pad ref to a ref, from a ref to a point and from a point to a ref refuses before any event, receiver_unproven on an XWayland pad and native_wayland_client on a native pad; the pad log, j/cursorpos and j/activewindow stay unchanged', 'Pointer pad on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog'), 'asserted-refusal', 'ACTION_FAILED, kind receiver_evidence, causes receiver_unproven and native_wayland_client, physical_delivery_started false, not_delivered; a ref drag has no receiver proof on Hyprland'),
    ('pointer.ref_drag_headless_refused', 'Without headed permission, the same three ref drags on an XWayland and a native pad refuse with POLICY_DENIED before any event; the pad log, j/cursorpos and j/activewindow stay unchanged', 'Pointer pad on a nested instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'applog'), 'asserted-refusal', 'POLICY_DENIED, not_delivered, physical_delivery_started false; cursor, active window and pad log unchanged'),
    ('input.hyprland_headless_physical_keys_refused', 'With the key log unfocused on the shown workspace and then on a spare one while the bystander holds focus, a headless press by window id refuses with STALE_REF, check exact_window_focus, and by app name with ACTION_FAILED, check window_active, each exit 1, not_delivered and before any key: the app logs no key, the entry stays empty and j/activewindow, j/cursorpos and the workspaces stay with the bystander; a headless type then writes the entry through EditableText with no key event and no focus change', 'Key Log and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'applog'), 'asserted-refusal', 'STALE_REF with check exact_window_focus for press --window-id and ACTION_FAILED with check window_active for press --app, each not_delivered with no physical delivery started'),
    ('input.hyprland_press_return_one_newline', 'In the GTK3 zoo text view, headed type ab, scoped press return and headed type c leave ab, one newline and c, read through AT-SPI and from the zoo log, and j/devices lists the same keyboards', 'Zoo GTK3 and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'applog'), 'pass'),
    ('input.hyprland_press_select_all_backspace_clears', 'In the key log entry, headed type abc, scoped press ctrl+a and scoped press backspace clear the entry; the app logs one BackSpace press with no Control in its state, a later type of q reads back as q, and j/devices lists the same keyboards', 'Key Log and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'applog'), 'pass'),
    ('input.hyprland_press_tab_moves_focus', 'After a headed type into the GTK3 zoo entry, a scoped press tab moves focus to the next control, the password entry: it carries the focused state in AT-SPI, the zoo logs its focus event, the entry text has no tab, and j/devices lists the same keyboards', 'Zoo GTK3 and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'applog'), 'pass'),
    ('input.hyprland_keymap_variant_options_preserved', 'With kb_layout us, kb_variant dvorak and kb_options ctrl:nocaps set on the compositor, a headed type into the key log reads back exactly and the app sees h and e on their Dvorak keys; a scoped tab in the GTK3 zoo moves focus to the password entry; getoption and every keyboard in j/devices read back the same layout, variant, options and keymap name after typing and after Tab, and the original keymap comes back', 'Key Log, Zoo GTK3 and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'applog'), 'pass'),
    ('input.hyprland_focus_theft_before_first_key', 'When the key log takes focus from the GTK3 zoo just after a headed type into the zoo entry starts, the type refuses with not_delivered and no physical delivery started, the entry stays as it was, the key log logs no key in any attempt, and j/devices lists the same keyboards; an attempt where keys left before the steal is retried, up to three times', 'Zoo GTK3, Key Log and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'atspi', 'applog'), 'asserted-refusal', 'ACTION_FAILED or STALE_REF, not_delivered, physical_delivery_started false, from the focus gate before the first key-down'),
    ('pointer.coordinate_click_through_cursor', 'With the keep-drawn test flag in the renderer registry and the session cursor drawn over the button of an XWayland pad on the session instance, a headed mouse-click --xy at the cursor\'s tip logs exactly one press on the pad button and no other press, while j/layers and grim pixels read back to back from before the click until after the press show the cursor drawn throughout and after; a live holder without the flag clears the arrow first, so the pixel read tells drawn from cleared', 'Pointer pad', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADED, ('hyprland', 'applog', 'pixels', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('session.hyprland_silent_ipc_refused', 'A Hyprland endpoint that never accepts, or accepts and never replies, refuses list-displays when named, with or without the session display, and when discovery finds it beside the session instance; the session pair lists its outputs once the endpoint is gone; the desktop and its monitors stay unchanged', 'Hyprland session and socket fixtures', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland',), 'asserted-refusal', 'TIMEOUT with display_unavailable silent, retryable true and the endpoint socket as detail, exit 1, not_delivered within the budget; desktop and monitors unchanged'),
    ('session.hyprland_several_instances_ambiguous', 'With two live Hyprland instances, discovery with only the runtime directory, and with the session display, refuses list-displays as hyprland_ambiguous naming both signatures; each named pair still lists its own outputs; both desktops stay unchanged', 'Hyprland session and a second instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland',), 'asserted-refusal', 'PLATFORM_NOT_SUPPORTED with hyprland_ambiguous and details.signatures equal to the two live signatures, exit 1, not_delivered within the budget; both desktops and monitors unchanged'),
    ('session.hyprland_swapped_pair_mismatch', 'A signature paired with the other live instance Wayland display refuses list-displays as hyprland_mismatch, both ways round; both desktops stay unchanged', 'Hyprland session and a second instance', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland',), 'asserted-refusal', 'PLATFORM_NOT_SUPPORTED with hyprland_mismatch naming the bound signature and the foreign Wayland socket, exit 1, not_delivered within the budget; both desktops and monitors unchanged'),
    ('session.hyprland_effects_stay_on_bound_instance', 'list-windows under each pair lists compositor-only toplevels of that instance alone, under ids it issued, so only the second pair lists the sentinel; minimize and restore of the sentinel through the second pair show in its j/clients and leave the session instance j/clients and desktop unchanged, polled while they run; the sentinel id through the session pair is WINDOW_NOT_FOUND', 'Hyprland session, a second instance and its sentinel', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'proc'), 'pass'),
    ('identity.hyprland_two_processes_one_title', 'Two processes with one window title and one size each bind their own toplevel: minimize and restore by each frame id move that process toplevel in j/clients and leave the other process toplevel unchanged; focus and the desktop stay unchanged', 'Two Zoo GTK3 processes and bystander', HYPRLAND_ONLY, HEADLESS, ('hyprland', 'atspi'), 'pass'),
)
